    <statement><p><m>\mathbf{v} = \left\lt 3,12,19\right&gt;</m></p>
<p>Which of the following vectors is parallel to <m>\mathbf{v}</m>?</p>
<p><var form="buttons">
<li>
<p><m>\lt -12,19,-3&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\lt 3,-12,-19&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\lt 3,6,4.75&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\lt -3,-12,-19&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\lt 19,12,3&gt;</m></p>
</li>
</var></p>
<p>Which of the following points in the same direction as <m>\mathbf{v}</m>?</p>
<p><var form="buttons">
<li>
<p><m>\lt -12,19,-3&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\lt 3,-12,-19&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\lt 12,19,3&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\lt 6,24,38&gt;</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\lt -3,-12,-19&gt;</m></p>
</li>
</var></p>
</statement>
    <solution><m>\left\lt -3,-12,-19\right&gt;</m> is <m>-1 \mathbf{v}</m>, so it is parallel to <m>\mathbf{v}</m> (in the opposite direction).



<m>\left\lt 6,24,38\right&gt;</m> is <m>2 \mathbf{v}</m>, so it points in the same direction as <m>\mathbf{v}</m>.


</solution>
